  ::: tests/ui/ruby_habits.wid:41:3
   |
41 |   describe
   |   -------- `describe` expands here
   = note: `Self` names the type whose method this is
help: for the type's name, use `type_info(Self).name`
help: or compute the name in the macro, before the `quote` (`name = Self.name`), and splice it as a string: `#{name}`
